walk. } { [%c_effect b5;square;b5;type;GreatFind;persistent;true] }) 8. Re1 { Let's talk for a moment about this move and the old school idea
of overprotection. Imagine you are black's king, castling short is the only
viable long term haven. But you'll never be safe with the pawn on e5, the pawn
